ta-tex=\"\\mathrm{Low}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{Low}_T\\)</span> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"0b5840b17b35f1e7\" href=\"?note=0b5840b17b35f1e7\" title=\"67-df-degree-high-low\">67-df-degree-high-low</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cofinal}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{Cofinal}_T\\)</span> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"7ee1f80d5a223006\" href=\"?note=7ee1f80d5a223006\" title=\"67-df-degree-cofinality\">67-df-degree-cofinality</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall a\\in D_T\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Low}_T(a)\\leftrightarrow\\exists b\\in\\mathsf S_T\\;(a\\leq_Tb&lt;_T\\mathbf1_T)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall a\\in D_T\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Low}_T(a)\\leftrightarrow\\exists b\\in\\mathsf S_T\\;(a\\leq_Tb&lt;_T\\mathbf1_T)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cofinal}_T(\\mathsf P_T)\\land\\neg\\mathrm{Cofinal}_T(\\mathsf S_T).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Cofinal}_T(\\mathsf P_T)\\land\\neg\\mathrm{Cofinal}_T(\\mathsf S_T).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall a\\in D_T\\;(\\mathbf0_T&lt;_Ta\\to\\exists b\\in D_T\\;(b&lt;_Ta\\land\\forall c\\in\\mathsf S_T\\;\\neg(b\\leq_Tc&lt;_Ta))).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall a\\in D_T\\;(\\mathbf0_T&lt;_Ta\\to\\exists b\\in D_T\\;(b&lt;_Ta\\land\\forall c\\in\\mathsf S_T\\;\\neg(b\\leq_Tc&lt;_Ta))).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists a\\in\\mathsf P_T\\;(\\mathrm{Low}_T(a)\\land a\\notin\\mathsf S_T).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists a\\in\\mathsf P_T\\;(\\mathrm{Low}_T(a)\\land a\\notin\\mathsf S_T).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对应印刷104–105页/PDF115–116页：第一式为§3开头由引理7得到的 low 刻画，其上界允许等于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\">\\(a\\)</span>；余式为定理10。第(b)项不仅给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span> 度不共尾，还在每个非底度下给出一个不含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span> 度的半开区间。</p>\n<p>已读定理10及引理17：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_1\">\\(\\Pi_1\\)</span> 共尾性由一致性度集合的共尾性得到；对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a&gt;0\">\\(a&gt;0\\)</span> 选择满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\nleq_Tc\">\\(a\\nleq_Tc\\)</span> 的 high 度 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\">\\(c\\)</span>，取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\\wedge a\">\\(c\\wedge a\\)</span>，引理17排除其与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\">\\(a\\)</span> 之间的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span> 度；第(c)项再让同一构造从 low <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_1\">\\(\\Pi_1\\)</span> 度起步。完整来源辅助链未独立重证。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-degree-complexity","status":"resolved","id":"73717706953334f5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-degree-complexity]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-degree-high-low","status":"resolved","id":"0b5840b17b35f1e7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-degree-high-low]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-degree-cofinality","status":"resolved","id":"7ee1f80d5a223006","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location"